    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "🛡️ Harold, Zoe, Tashi and Ruth met them at the door — 4 put down. Harold, Zoe, Tashi, Ruth are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 26,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Marcus just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "🛡️ Kelsey, Harold, Ruth and Stan met them at the door — 1 put down, 3 barely walked away. Kelsey, Harold, Ruth, Stan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Amy just put down The Redactor... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
